...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

user: 사용자 (브라우저) { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI (app.py) { class: ours }

agent_scope: "에이전트 실행 범위\nbefore/after_agent_callback" {
  class: ours
  direction: down

  model_scope: "모델 호출 범위\nbefore/after_model_callback" {
    class: ours
    direction: down

    gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }

    tool_scope: "도구 실행 범위\nbefore/after_tool_callback" {
      class: ours
      tool_fn: 계산기 도구 (calculator_tool) { class: ours }
    }
  }
}

user -> ui: 채팅 메시지
ui -> agent_scope: run_agent(message)
agent_scope.model_scope -> agent_scope.model_scope.gemini: 모델 요청
agent_scope.model_scope.gemini -> agent_scope.model_scope.tool_scope.tool_fn: 함수 호출 응답이면 위임
agent_scope.model_scope.tool_scope.tool_fn -> agent_scope.model_scope.gemini: 결과를 담아 재요청
agent_scope.model_scope.gemini -> ui: 최종 텍스트
ui -> user: 화면에 표시
